MDL102, F1, F12 for myloader: the whitespace-only line makes myloader ignore
its whole config file too. It still connects through [client] and exits 0,
but "no-data" is not applied: the rows are restored. The harness first dumps
the seeded database into /work/source-dump with the same image.
-- scenario --
tool: myloader
versions: >= v0.19.3-1
args: --defaults-file /work/myloader.cnf --directory /work/source-dump --database ${RESTORE_DB}
lint: MDL102, MDL405
expect config-loaded: false
expect exit: 0
expect rows ${RESTORE_DB}.users: 3
-- myloader.cnf.esc --
[client]\nhost=mysql\nuser=e2e\npassword=e2e-password\n\n[myloader]\nthreads=2\n\x20\x20\nno-data=1\n
